  {
   "kind": "field_value",
   "field_name": "Primary Text",
   "text": "Momcozy | Wearable & Wireless Pumps | Best Momcozy Wearable Pump | M5:Only $225.25 CAD | Hot Sale: M5 Smart&Air 1&M6 | Best Wireless Milk Pump | More Milk More Discreet | Momcozy® Official Site – CA | Buy Momcozy Breast Pump | Easy to Use | Official Momcozy CA Store | Hands-Free Wearable Pumps | Free Shipping to Canada | Pump Anytime, Anywhere | Compare & Find Your Fit | Momcozy wearable breast pumps fit inside your bra. No tubes, no cords. Shop now in CA | Quiet, portable & hands-free. Multiple modes & flange sizes for a custom, comfy fit. | From S12 Pro to M9 — compare top-rated pumps. Free shipping & 30-day returns in Canada. | Hospital-grade suction in a wireless design. App control, long battery life & more.",
   "anchor": "#广告文案明细/recvuJYdObN3eh/Primary Text"
  },
  {
   "kind": "field_value",
   "field_name": "修改建议",
   "text": "删除 more milk/增产催奶/催产素/长期奶量/裸奶阵排空承诺；合规替代为放松叙事+限定语，如 relaxation supports your natural let-down, which may help your flow（因为放松，自然奶阵可能更顺畅），只描述自然生理过程、不承诺产品带来结果；faster let-down/提高排空效率在拿到W1自身对照数据前禁用 ▸ 效果百分比/销量/评分声称需附测试来源与口径，否则删除（折扣百分比不在此列） ▸ hospital/NICU 场景表述需事实依据，否则删除 ▸ hospital/medical grade 需认证依据，否则删除",
